{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Eastwynne",
    "steam_appid": 3732610,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732610/extras/cbe1f8653335a5fffb28e113b7c9e120.avif?t=1750904956\" width=800 height=267 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo releasing June 2025!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo will be a side story giving you a sneak peek of what's to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732610/extras/a9d8752359351ae6ce2fcdfa7f0a2fbb.avif?t=1750904956\" width=680 height=237 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Ester <i><strong>or</strong></i> Sye, seeing 2 different perspectives of Eastwynne. How they react and, conversely, how the world reacts to them.\u00a0 Similarly to our <i>irl</i> Earth, this society is abundant with culture, history, and magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732610/extras/c5d0e68d272252376c352cfdedbfc399.avif?t=1750904956\" width=680 height=237 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions will affect the course of the story, what you learn, what you can accomplish, and who chooses to stand beside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the pressure of decision-making is getting to you, there are difficulty options that will give you hints about major choices and decrease the difficulty of dice rolls and battles. <i>Or you can live life on the edge and have no consequence warnings at all...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732610/extras/c33d77003ba9ce953c6d796f8c0bd7ef.avif?t=1750904956\" width=680 height=237 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic flows everywhere. Develop skills and learn new spells, leading towards specific specializations that can aid you both in exploration and beyond. Learn what works and doesn't, what you can counter, and what you're weak against. Magic doesn't always equate to violence, but sometimes it does\u200b.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2756 Features \u2756</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Storylines</strong>: Influence the paths that should be taken and change the narrative. Be warned, your actions have consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friends, Foes, and Everything in Between</strong>: It's a big world with many characters. Will you make friends or foes? Who knows whether they like you or not may have nothing to do with your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic and Battles</strong>: Learn new skills and spells through lessons and other sources. Apply what you've learned while exploring and in combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voiced in English featuring a super amazing cast</strong>\u00a0\ud83d\udc96</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732610/extras/cbe1f8653335a5fffb28e113b7c9e120.avif?t=1750904956\" width=800 height=267 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo releasing June 2025!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo will be a side story giving you a sneak peek of what's to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732610/extras/a9d8752359351ae6ce2fcdfa7f0a2fbb.avif?t=1750904956\" width=680 height=237 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Ester <i><strong>or</strong></i> Sye, seeing 2 different perspectives of Eastwynne. How they react and, conversely, how the world reacts to them.\u00a0 Similarly to our <i>irl</i> Earth, this society is abundant with culture, history, and magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732610/extras/c5d0e68d272252376c352cfdedbfc399.avif?t=1750904956\" width=680 height=237 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions will affect the course of the story, what you learn, what you can accomplish, and who chooses to stand beside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the pressure of decision-making is getting to you, there are difficulty options that will give you hints about major choices and decrease the difficulty of dice rolls and battles. <i>Or you can live life on the edge and have no consequence warnings at all...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732610/extras/c33d77003ba9ce953c6d796f8c0bd7ef.avif?t=1750904956\" width=680 height=237 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic flows everywhere. Develop skills and learn new spells, leading towards specific specializations that can aid you both in exploration and beyond. Learn what works and doesn't, what you can counter, and what you're weak against. Magic doesn't always equate to violence, but sometimes it does\u200b.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2756 Features \u2756</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Storylines</strong>: Influence the paths that should be taken and change the narrative. Be warned, your actions have consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friends, Foes, and Everything in Between</strong>: It's a big world with many characters. Will you make friends or foes? Who knows whether they like you or not may have nothing to do with your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic and Battles</strong>: Learn new skills and spells through lessons and other sources. Apply what you've learned while exploring and in combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voiced in English featuring a super amazing cast</strong>\u00a0\ud83d\udc96</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "A choose your own adventure RPG set in the grandiose city of Eastwynne, where magic is commonplace. Follow the stories of a group of university students; how will your choices alter their lives?",
